## The ice hides deep secrets

Return to Planet 4546B in Subnautica: Below Zero, the long-awaited sequel to the acclaimed open-world underwater survival hit. This time, survival isn't just about oxygen—it's about heat. Prepare to brave the freezing temperatures of an unexplored arctic region, where danger lurks both beneath the waves and across the frozen surface.

Adventure Awaits
Set two years after the original game, you step into the fins of Robin Ayou, a scientist determined to uncover the truth behind her sister’s mysterious disappearance. Between abandoned research stations and cryptic clues, you’ll find yourself immersed in a narrative thick with mystery, aliens, and extreme survival.


KEY FEATURES
Unravel the Mystery: Investigate your sister’s fate and dig deep into the history of the Precursors. Who were the aliens that inhabited this world? Why did they leave? Every scrap of info brings you closer to a truth that could change everything.

Master the Arctic Winter: The cold is a relentless enemy. Monitor your body temperature: craft advanced thermal suits, consume piping hot beverages, and utilize natural heat sources like Thermal Lilies to keep the frost at bay.

Build and Pilot: Design complex habitats to shield yourself from the elements. Zip across snowy plains on the lightning-fast Snowfox hoverbike, or explore the depths with the Seatruck—a unique modular vehicle you can customize with sleeper berths, aquariums, or mobile workshops.

Breathtaking Biomes: Explore spectacular and lethal environments. From the bioluminescent labyrinths of the Twisty Bridges to the majestic Crystal Caves and the frozen peaks of the Glacial Basin. Every corner of 4546B hides alien artifacts and precious resources.

A Brand New Ecosystem: Encounter extraordinary fauna. Get up close with curious Pengwings, play with mischievous Sea Monkeys, or try to escape the jaws of the terrifying Shadow Leviathan. Remember: in this world, curiosity can be as rewarding as it is deadly.


OPTIMIZED FOR MOBILE
This version has been entirely redesigned to deliver peak performance on Android devices without compromising visual quality:

Intuitive Touch Interface: A completely revamped UI for fluid, responsive menu navigation and inventory management.

Google Play Games Integration: Climb the leaderboards and unlock exclusive achievements to prove your survival skills.

Dynamic Cloud Saves: Never lose your progress. Thanks to cloud saving, you can resume your expedition on any Android device, anywhere, anytime.

Are you ready to face the frozen abyss? Planet 4546B is waiting.